comptime CLI_HELP = "usage: zz [global flags] <command> [flags]\n\nglobal flags\n  --host NAME|DEST|all  run on a host from zz list-hosts, an ssh destination, or every host (read-only verbs)\n  -L NAME, -S PATH, -f FILE  tmux socket and config flags; zz -h lists the rest\n\nzz verbs\n  agent-respond  Answer a pending permission and print the selected option ID\n  agent-send  Send a prompt to an agent chat, or text to another agent in a terminal pane\n  capture-browser  Save a browser pane's current frame as a PNG\n  choose-path  Pick a path and insert it at the cursor\n  copy-mode-search-prompt  Open the copy-mode search prompt\n  debug-marker  Write a marker to the daemon log\n  events  Stream hook events as JSON lines until disconnected\n  fleet  Add, list, and remove hosts in zz/config, install zz on them, and share zz's ssh key\n  flip-agent  Flip a pane between an agent CLI and its chat, resuming the same session\n  html  Show an HTML file or directory an agent wrote in a browser pane that reloads when it changes\n  focus-sidebar  Focus the workspace sidebar\n  import-tmux-config  Copy the host tmux configuration into zz/mux.conf and reload\n  inspect  Describe panes: kind, process, agent and browser facts, applicable verbs\n  list-hosts  List the machines in zz/config with their state and zz version\n  reload-config  Reload zz configuration\n  run-pane  Run a command in a POSIX terminal shell and return its output and exit code\n  send-last-output  Draft a terminal's last command and output into the window's agent\n  send-text  Paste text into a terminal pane, wait for it to land, then press Enter\n  set-browser-profile  Switch a browser pane to another profile\n  set-browser-url  Navigate a browser pane\n  show-last-output  Print a terminal's last command and output\n  tools  Show workspace commands, optionally limited to agent, terminal, browser, or advanced\n  wait-pane  Wait for terminal output, an idle interval, or child exit\n\ntmux commands\n  new-session (new)\n  list-sessions (ls)\n  rename-session (rename)\n  kill-session\n  attach-session (attach)\n  has-session (has)\n  suspend-client (suspendc)\n  detach-client (detach)\n  list-clients (lsc)\n  refresh-client (refresh)\n  new-window (neww)\n  list-windows (lsw)\n  rename-window (renamew)\n  select-window (selectw)\n  next-window (next)\n  previous-window (prev)\n  last-window (last)\n  kill-window (killw)\n  move-window (movew)\n  swap-window (swapw)\n  find-window (findw)\n  split-window (splitw)\n  new-pane (newp)\n  break-pane (breakp)\n  join-pane (joinp)\n  move-pane (movep)\n  select-pane (selectp)\n  last-pane (lastp)\n  swap-pane (swapp)\n  list-panes (lsp)\n  resize-pane (resizep)\n  resize-window (resizew)\n  select-layout (selectl)\n  next-layout (nextl)\n  previous-layout (prevl)\n  rotate-window (rotatew)\n  kill-pane (killp)\n  respawn-pane (respawnp)\n  respawn-window (respawnw)\n  send-keys (send)\n  send-prefix\n  copy-mode\n  command-prompt\n  choose-tree\n  choose-client\n  choose-buffer\n  display-message (display)\n  show-messages (showmsgs)\n  display-panes (displayp)\n  clear-history (clearhist)\n  customize-mode\n  clock-mode\n  switch-mode\n  bind-key (bind)\n  unbind-key (unbind)\n  list-keys (lsk)\n  list-commands (lscm)\n  set-hook\n  show-hooks\n  set-option (set)\n  set-window-option (setw)\n  show-options (show)\n  show-window-options (showw)\n  set-environment (setenv)\n  show-environment (showenv)\n  source-file (source)\n  start-server (start)\n  server-access\n  kill-server\n  capture-pane (capturep)\n  clear-prompt-history (clearphist)\n  show-prompt-history (showphist)\n  if-shell (if)\n  run-shell (run)\n  delete-buffer (deleteb)\n  list-buffers (lsb)\n  load-buffer (loadb)\n  paste-buffer (pasteb)\n  save-buffer (saveb)\n  set-buffer (setb)\n  show-buffer (showb)\n  wait-for (wait)\n  pipe-pane (pipep)\n  display-popup (popup)\n  display-menu (menu)\n  confirm-before (confirm)\n  lock-client (lockc)\n  lock-server (lock)\n  lock-session (locks)\n  switch-client (switchc)\n\nnot implemented\n  link-window\n  linkw\n  unlink-window\n  unlinkw\n\nRun zz tools for the agent guide.\n"
